# Added 2026-08-25 00:47Z, card-free, on the second item of the goal-pricing note.
v3base_dense_s2026.pt       # 0.8455 — the STRONG end of the DINOv3-BASE family, which the package has
# never held. Until now the only DINOv3-base member shipped was dinov3_base_lora_s2026 at 0.8268, and
# that gap is not an architecture fact: it is LoRA-over-frozen against full adaptation on the same trunk,
# +0.0187 for the adaptation, one of the two inherited-hyperparameter defects the 2026-08-24 audit found
# written up as facts about encoders. So every entry that has ever varied the encoder FAMILY on the board
# varied it with the weak reading of it.
#
# It costs no slot and no card — the trunk's weights are already mounted at dimiturnt/dinov3-hf/vitb16,
# and it is converged rather than truncated (12 epochs asked, 12 run, peak before the last).
